  "decision_conditions": [
    "The Council consider that the development would not comply with Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A parts A.1 (c), (d), (h) and (ja) of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 2015. Specifically:",
    "1. The height of the part of the dwellinghouse enlarged exceeds the height of the highest part of the roof of the existing dwellinghouse;",
    "2. The height of the eaves of the part of the dwellinghouse enlarged exceeds the height of the eaves of the existing dwellinghouse;",
    "3. The enlarged part of the dwellinghouse has more than one storey and extends beyond the rear wall of the original dwellinghouse by more than 3 metres and,",
    "4. The proposed development would be joined to an existing enlargement of the original dwellinghouse that is within 2 metres of the boundary of the curtilage and the height of its eaves exceeds 3 metres.",
    "The applicant should note that the submitted HM Land Registry plan does not show properties along Mayfield Grove or nos. 24, 26, 27 and 29 Surridge Close and therefore does not accurately depict the locality surrounding the application site."
